{"unit_id":"wodebilu__dsh-session-editor#card-zh","repo":"wodebilu/dsh-session-editor","commit":"065ae9c45d706d1f3bdfba53f6854a0c4a180216","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-editor 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的会话管理插件，通过 Host 命令和 Web 界面扩展提供会话编辑操作。它可以永久删除本机保存的会话，在已完成回答旁重新生成、修改提问后重发或删除该轮及之后的内容，也能复制或编辑自己的输入。编辑操作通过创建替代会话来实现，并打开新会话；删除命令要求显式确认。适合需要整理 DSH 对话、修订提问或重新生成回答的网页端用户。插件不需要 API 密钥、账号或额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-78","client.js:354-380","client.js:502-568"]}
{"unit_id":"wodebilu__dsh-session-editor#card-en","repo":"wodebilu/dsh-session-editor","commit":"065ae9c45d706d1f3bdfba53f6854a0c4a180216","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-editor extends the DSH web client with session deletion and conversation editing. It can regenerate answers, resend edited prompts, truncate later turns, and copy or edit your own messages. Edits create a replacement session. No API key or extra configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-78","client.js:354-380","client.js:502-568"]}
