{"unit_id":"wodebilu__dsh-session-editor#feature-1","repo":"wodebilu/dsh-session-editor","commit":"065ae9c45d706d1f3bdfba53f6854a0c4a180216","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-editor 的功能「永久删除会话」：通过会话行菜单打开确认框，确认后删除指定会话。也可使用 /session-editor delete <sessionId> --confirm 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-78","client.js:572-609"]}
