{"unit_id":"wodebilu__dsh-session-editor#caveat-1","repo":"wodebilu/dsh-session-editor","commit":"065ae9c45d706d1f3bdfba53f6854a0c4a180216","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-editor 使用前须知：编辑会创建替代会话并永久删除原会话；删除操作无法撤销，可能带附件的输入重发时附件不会带入，界面会提示确认。见 client.js:354-380、client.js:693-720。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:354-380","client.js:693-720"]}
